		0xAAA633, and the background pixel has an RGB value of 0xDD2200, the
		resulting RGB value for the displayed pixel is 0xFFC833 (because 0xAA +
		0xDD > 0xFF, 0xA6 + 0x22 = 0xC8, and 0x33 + 0x00 = 0x33).
