		0xFFCC33, and the background pixel has an RGB value of 0xDDF800, the
		resulting RGB value for the displayed pixel is 0xDDCC00 (because 0xFF >
		0xDD, 0xCC < 0xF8, and 0x33 > 0x00 = 33).

