	@see [Initializing a FileStream object, and opening and closing files](https://books.openfl.org/openfl-developers-guide/working-with-the-file-system/initializing-a-filestream-object-and-opening-and-closing-files.html)
	@see [The position property of a FileStream object](https://books.openfl.org/openfl-developers-guide/working-with-the-file-system/the-position-property-of-a-filestream-object.html)
	@see [The read buffer and the bytesAvailable property of a FileStream object](https://books.openfl.org/openfl-developers-guide/working-with-the-file-system/the-read-buffer-and-the-bytesavailable-property-of-a-filestream-object.html)
	@see [Asynchronous programming and the events generated by a FileStream object opened asynchronously](https://books.openfl.org/openfl-developers-guide/working-with-the-file-system/asynchronous-programming-and-the-events-generated-by-a-filestream-object-opened-asynchronously.html)
	@see [Data formats, and choosing the read and write methods to use](https://books.openfl.org/openfl-developers-guide/working-with-the-file-system/data-formats-and-choosing-the-read-and-write-methods-to-use.html)
	@see `openfl.filesystem.File`
**/
@:access(openfl.utils.ByteArray)
@:access(openfl.utils.ByteArrayData)
@:access(openfl.filesystem.File)
#if !openfl_debug
@:fileXml('tags="haxe,release"') @:noDebug
